<Layout title="Landlink photograph · NZ GIS History"><article class="page-wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Image reference</p><h1>Landlink, May 1999</h1><p>Page 1 of Landlink, Issue 8 (May 1999), contains the article “LINZ first in mapping” and a photograph of the New Zealand Topographic Digital Database team. The clipping was provided by Nathan Heazlewood.</p><p>The local image copy is currently unavailable. Its caption and named people remain in the <a href="/entities/department-of-survey-and-land-information-dosli/">DOSLI photograph account</a>.</p><p><a href="https://history.pm4gis.nz/assets/images/landlink-1999-topographic-database.jpg">Open the original publication’s image reference</a></p><p><a href="/images/">Image archive</a></p></article></Layout>
